For my project I'm looking at how track shoes and running surfaces have changed over time. I'm mostly interested in how the materials, shapes, and designs have developed and how that might have helped athletes run faster.

I also want to look at how the shoes have changed in appearance, since older spikes look a lot different from what we use today. I'm planning on comparing pictures of different shoes, looking at what they're made of, and seeing how running times have improved over the years.

I'm still figuring out exactly how I want to put everything together, but the main idea is just to show how track equipment has changed and improved over time.
